# Optional path for scripts/benchmark-recording, scripts/verify-native-recording,
# and scripts/verify. Existing absolute, resolved directory with mode 0700,
# outside the repository and asset layouts. Distinct SwiftPM children are retained.
# Leave unset to use the existing build/ paths; an empty value is invalid.
# COLE_VOICE_NATIVE_SCRATCH_ROOT=/private/tmp/cole-native-verification-scratch
